      "content": "The new coordinator rule allows Exit without a reason when the Plan Call is Out, but this form still sets `required = action !== 'Hold'` and returns early on an empty reason before calling `facade.DailyReview.save`. Consequently, that newly supported save (including changing a saved Action to Exit) remains impossible through the UI; handling `IntentRequired` here does not fix the client-side rejection. Update the local validation and required/optional label to use the Plan Call rule, or defer reason validation to the coordinator.",
